;; 4-2-exit: the original's pieces for the other map difficulties and for heroes with level flags
;; (generated by tools/levelgen/convert-smbc.mjs --layers from levelDataSmb.xml; do not edit by hand).
;; Classic play lays, in order, each layer whose flags the hero has and whose difficulty is the
;; run's or any (level/layers.ts). The .map file holds Normal for a hero with no flags.

[layer easy]
12 3 $$$
11 4 $$BB
10 5 $$
14 5 B
9 6 $$
14 6 B
8 7 $$
14 7 B
7 8 $$
14 8 B
6 9 $$
14 9 B
5 10 $$
14 10 B
5 11 $
14 11 B
14 12 B

[layer hard]
9 5 mmmmm
11 6 i..
10 7 .i..
4 8 mmm
9 8 ..i..
5 9 i
8 9 ...i..
5 10 i
7 10 ....i..
1 11 []..i.....i..
1 12 {}..i.....i..
0 13 .{}..i.....i..........
0 14 .{}..i.....i..........
- piranha 3 11
+ piranha 1 11
+ koopa-red 12 4 dx=8
start 1 10 pipe-exit

[layer horz]
+ lift-fall 17 4 len=2 dx=8

[layer easy horz]
- lift-fall 17 4
+ lift-fall 18 4 len=2
